# TurboFex - instructions for AI agents
Read these, in this order, BEFORE you change anything:
1. `OWNER_PREFERENCES.private.md` (main folder): the owner's private, lasting preferences and rules. It is git-ignored and not on GitHub. If it is missing, stop and ask the owner for it.
2. `AGENTS.md`: how the project is pushed, packaged and released, and the hard rules.
3. `PROJECT_GUIDE.md`: how the code works.
Save any new lasting preference the owner states into the private file at once, never delete old lines, and ask the owner when an instruction is unclear or conflicts with a saved rule.
